{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表。\n書いてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/07/6924968/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これに尽きるなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"報われない努力もあるかもしれない。\n意味のない努力もあるかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力をしなければなにも始まらない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不断の努力」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"負けない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、年始の握手会には大勢の皆さんが来て下さってほんとう嬉しかった(o^^o)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも力、もらってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つぎ会うときにはもっとパワーアップした自分でいたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつ成長した自分でいたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もひとつ変わった自分でいたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、もうすぐ個別なんだけどね(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまあ、それくらいの勢いで変わっていきたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間として、\nアイドルとして、\nタレントとして、\n高校生として、\n娘として、\n一皮むけた、変化した、成長した姿。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見せていきたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/01/07/6924968/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、迷わない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}